  "fullScript": "What if the entire global internet was deleted for seventy-two hours? At 12:01 AM... every screen on Earth freezes. Instantly, thirty thousand commercial airplanes lose GPS navigation and are forced to fly blind! By 8:00 AM, every credit card and ATM on the planet is dead, leaving billions of people unable to buy food. Supply chains completely freeze because delivery trucks rely on digital dispatch. Within forty-eight hours, power grids begin desyncing, plunging entire continents into pitch black darkness! Erasing over twelve trillion dollars in digital wealth. Proving that modern civilization doesn't run on money... it runs on invisible data packets. Which is why, if your Wi-Fi suddenly disappeared...",
